' Capability profile sent with every /play negotiation -- see
' http-client-contract.md's "Capability profile" section: union-with-
' baseline, never subtract; `containers` must include "hls" or the server
' returns 503 Unsupported.
'
' v1 simplification (documented, not silent): always the baseline, no real
' roDeviceInfo.CanDecodeVideo()/display-mode probe yet. This is safe by
' construction -- under-advertising capability only ever costs the server
' an unnecessary transcode, it can never cause a played-but-undecodable
' stream. See platform-notes/roku.md.
namespace Swarm.Capability
    function Baseline() as object
        return {
            containers: ["mp4", "hls"]
            video_codecs: ["h264:high@4.2"]
            audio_codecs: ["aac", "ac3", "mp3"]
            max_width: 1920
            max_height: 1080
            max_bitrate: 20000000
            hdr: false
        }
    end function
end namespace
